<%- include('../partials/header') %>

<main id="main">
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container hero__grid">
      <div class="hero__copy reveal">
        <span class="eyebrow">About Pimofy Digital</span>
        <h1>Be the Answer: The AI Visibility &amp; Growth Partner</h1>
        <p class="lead">We help SaaS &amp; Ecommerce companies get found, chosen and recommended in Google and AI assistants, and we give their teams the dedicated data operations capacity to keep up with the demand that follows.</p>
        <a href="/contact" class="btn btn--primary btn--lg">Book a Free Consultation</a>
      </div>
      <div class="hero__media reveal" data-delay="1">
        <picture>
          <source srcset="/assets/team.webp" type="image/webp" />
          <img src="/assets/team.jpg" alt="The Pimofy team collaborating in the office" width="1024" height="768" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" />
        </picture>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--soft">
    <div class="container prose-block">
      <div class="section__head reveal"><h2>Who We Are</h2></div>
      <div class="reveal">
        <p>Pimofy Digital is Nairobi-based, serving businesses across the USA, UK, Europe and Africa. Our AI Visibility &amp; Growth services are for any business that wins customers by being found online; our Data Operations service is built for SaaS and Ecommerce.</p>
        <p>Search has changed. Your buyers now ask ChatGPT, Gemini, Perplexity and Google&rsquo;s AI Overviews before they ever visit a vendor&rsquo;s website. The brands those engines mention, cite and recommend win the shortlist. We exist to make sure your brand is one of them.</p>
        <p>We do that with two connected engines:</p>
        <ul class="prose-list">
          <li><strong>AI Visibility &amp; Growth:</strong> answer-ready websites, AI-powered SEO, Answer Engine Optimization, Generative Engine Optimization and schema markup that turn search and AI visibility into qualified pipeline.</li>
          <li><strong>Data Operations:</strong> a dedicated, QA-backed specialist who takes on the repetitive data work behind your growth, from CRM hygiene to catalogue accuracy.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container prose-block">
      <div class="section__head reveal"><h2>We Build AI Products, Not Just Websites</h2></div>
      <div class="reveal">
        <p>Most agencies optimise for AI from the outside. We build with it. Our team has designed and shipped AI-powered products and platforms, including a career intelligence platform, a WhatsApp-based AI bookkeeper and an AI certificate system. We know how these systems read, interpret and recommend information because we build for them every day.</p>
        <p><a class="link" href="/work">See our work &rarr;</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--soft">
    <div class="container prose-block">
      <div class="section__head reveal"><h2>Why We Started Pimofy</h2></div>
      <div class="reveal">
        <p>We kept seeing the same two problems in growing SaaS and Ecommerce companies. Good brands were invisible in the places buyers had started searching. And skilled, expensive people were buried in repetitive data work instead of growing the business.</p>
        <p>Pimofy was built to solve both: make the brand impossible to overlook in AI search, and give the team back the capacity to serve the customers that visibility brings in.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="founders-title">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section__head reveal"><span class="eyebrow">Leadership</span><h2 id="founders-title">Our Founders</h2><p class="section__intro">Pimofy Digital was co-founded in Nairobi, Kenya by Moses Njeru Munyi and Peter Wafula.</p></div>
      <div class="grid grid--2" style="max-width:760px;margin:0 auto;">
        <article class="card card--feature text-center reveal"><h3>Moses Njeru Munyi</h3><p>Co-founder</p><a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/moses-njeru-munyi-b02156b2/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LinkedIn profile &rarr;</a></article>
        <article class="card card--feature text-center reveal" data-delay="1"><h3>Peter Wafula</h3><p>Co-founder</p><a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/peter-wafula-7351b35b/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LinkedIn profile &rarr;</a></article>
      </div>
      <p class="text-center reveal" style="margin-top:20px;"><a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/pimofy-digital/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Follow Pimofy Digital on LinkedIn &rarr;</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section__head reveal"><h2>What We Believe</h2></div>
      <div class="grid grid--4">
        <div class="card belief-card reveal"><h3>Visibility Is Earned, Not Bought</h3><p>Clear, accurate, trustworthy information is what both people and AI systems reward.</p></div>
        <div class="card belief-card reveal" data-delay="1"><h3>Outcomes Over Output</h3><p>We measure success in AI share of voice, qualified leads and reclaimed hours, not pages delivered.</p></div>
        <div class="card belief-card reveal" data-delay="2"><h3>Quality Is a System</h3><p>Agreed standards, SOPs, QA and weekly reporting make results repeatable.</p></div>
        <div class="card belief-card reveal" data-delay="3"><h3>Discretion by Default</h3><p>We work under your NDA and confidentiality requirements as standard.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--soft">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section__head reveal"><h2>The Numbers That Define Us</h2></div>
      <div class="grid grid--4 reveal">
        <div class="card text-center stat-card"><div class="stat__num">98%</div><div class="stat__label">Average QA accuracy across our data operations clients</div></div>
        <div class="card text-center stat-card"><div class="stat__num">80%</div><div class="stat__label">Average backlog reduction across our data operations clients</div></div>
        <div class="card text-center stat-card"><div class="stat__num">160</div><div class="stat__label">Dedicated hours per specialist, per month</div></div>
        <div class="card text-center stat-card"><div class="stat__num">NDA</div><div class="stat__label">Confidentiality as standard on every engagement</div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section cta-band">
    <div class="container cta-band__grid reveal">
      <div class="cta-band__text"><h2>Let&rsquo;s Make Your Brand the One AI Recommends</h2><p>Book a free consultation. We&rsquo;ll show you how Google and leading AI assistants describe your brand today, where your team is losing time, and the fastest path to both.</p></div>
      <div class="cta-band__action cta-band__action--stack"><a href="/contact" class="btn btn--white btn--lg">Book a Free Consultation</a></div>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>

